      "writtenOn": "2014-10-29T02:00:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "if you wait here, all you\u0027re doing is preventing the hooks task from sending another VDM, but another task could still send a VDM. we may need to address this at some point by queuing things up in pd_send_vdm(), but that\u0027s a seperate CL.\n\nif you are worried about another hpd event that calls pd_send_hpd() from the hooks task before the previous vdm finished, then the timeout here should be 3*2.7ms (3 tries, 2.7ms timeout) to handle longest possible time.",
